Order quantities

Fields
    requested: Requested item count
    available: Available stock count
    unit_price: Unit price in cents
    allocation: Fulfillable item count
    total: Order cost in cents
    remaining: Stock after allocation


Expose
    read: requested
    read: available
    read: unit_price
    read: allocation
    read: total
    read: remaining
    invoke: self
    invoke: allocation
    read: currency

State
    currency: "USD"
